## Standard dashboard anatomy (har role par lagu)
```
[Top bar]   Facility/branch switcher · global search (⌘K) · date range · notifications bell · role badge · shift/duty status
[Row 1]     KPI cards (4-8)  : value + delta vs yesterday/last week + sparkline + threshold colour + click → drill-down page
[Row 2]     Alerts & action center (severity, age, ack/snooze) | Today's tasks / SLA timers
[Row 3]     Primary worklists (tables with row actions, filters, saved views, bulk actions)
[Row 4]     Role-specific domain modules (cards / boards / maps / charts)
[Row 5]     Analytics (trends, compare, export) · Documents/SOP links · Help & support
[Footer]    last refreshed time · data freshness badge · "report an issue"
```
### Global elements (har dashboard)
1. **Header context:** facility switcher, shift, on-duty toggle (clinical roles), language (en/hi), theme.
2. **Realtime:** socket rooms `user:{id}`, `role:{key}`, `facility:{id}`; badge counts; "new item" toast; fallback polling 30-60s.
3. **Command palette (⌘K):** patient/UHID/bill/lab no. search (`/search/all`) + role actions.
4. **Alert Center:** severity (info/warn/critical), ack/snooze/escalate; critical = persistent banner (no auto-dismiss).
5. **Role-based widgets only:** sidebar/permissions se (`permissions[]` in spec) filtered, **T3 PHI shielding** (mask phone/ID for non-clinical roles).
6. **Empty / error / offline states** har widget ke (per-widget retry, never blank page).
7. **Export & print:** CSV/PDF with audit log.
8. **Audit:** sensitive actions (refund, discount, discharge, override) → `AuditLog` + approval engine.

### KPI rules (must)
- Har KPI: `key`, `label`, `source` (endpoint), `formula`, `unit`, `format`, `thresholds` (warn/crit), `drilldownHref`, `refreshSec`, `owner`.
- **Kabhi fake default nahi:** API khali ho to `—` + "no data" badge, **`|| 5`/`?? 12` jaise fallbacks hatao** (76 lines in `useLiveKpis.ts`). Loading = skeleton; error = retry chip.
- Time-scope explicit (aaj/7d/30d), timezone IST, business-day cutover midnight IST.
- Comparison: vs previous period (▲▼ %).
- Tenant/facility scoped; KPI numbers drill-down list se reconcile hone chahiye (test).

### Spec schema v2 (proposal: `HmsDashboardConfig` extend)
```ts
interface DashboardSpecV2 {
  roleKey: string; layer: 1|2|3|4|5|6; title: string; subtitle: string;
  permissions: string[];
  header: { facilitySwitcher: boolean; shiftToggle?: boolean; dateRange?: boolean };
  kpis: Array<{ key: string; label: string; endpoint: string; path: string; format: 'int'|'currency'|'pct'|'duration';
               warnAt?: number; critAt?: number; compare?: 'prevDay'|'prevWeek'; drilldown: string; refreshSec?: number }>;
  worklists: Array<{ key: string; title: string; endpoint: string; columns: string[]; rowActions: string[]; filters: string[]; bulk?: string[] }>;
  alerts: Array<{ ruleKey: string; severity: 'info'|'warning'|'critical'; ackRequired?: boolean }>;
  quickActions: Array<{ label: string; href: string; permission?: string; hotkey?: string }>;
  sections: Array<{ key: string; label: string; widgets: string[] }>;   // tabs
  domainModules: Array<{ key: string; label: string; href: string }>;
  mobile?: { priority: string[]; offline?: boolean };
}
```
Isse static `value: "₹3.42L"` hat ke endpoint-driven KPIs aayenge; `RoleDashboardShell` generic renderer use karega (naye role = sirf spec file).

